// Two-storey office block. A corridor runs east–west through both floors (z 5–7) with offices on
// either side; the stairwell is at the east end (x 19–26, z 0–5). Upstairs, one partition has
// collapsed and part of the south-west office floor has fallen through.
// Exterior wall segments: 0 north (x 0→26), 1 east (z 0→12), 2 south (x 26→0, at_m = 26 − x),
// 3 west (z 12→0, at_m = 12 − z).
